==Description==
'''Frost Spirit Charm''' is an exclusive charm introduced in the [[Operation I.C.E Event]] as a reward for reaching Level 24 on the premium track. It had a cost of {{Bell|780}} or {{Robux|128}} to unlock, with a total cost of {{Bell|8,990}} or {{Robux|2,145}}.

==Appearance==
'''Frost Spirit Charm''' appearance is based on [[Frost Spirit]], the final boss of the [[Operation I.C.E Event]]. It has the [[Frost Spirit]] generating a giant snowflake with its left hand. When placed down, it plays a sound of a crystallic object behind dropped down.

The charm has a light blue color with a crystallized texture. It does not change colors.

